# How to prompt Cursor for this repo

Paste one of these after pointing at `AGENTS.md`. Do not paste the entire product vision.

## Phase 0

```
Read AGENTS.md. Implement Phase 0 only: web+api skeleton, SQLite schema for sessions/metrics/events/patterns, local data dirs, shell UI routes (Record, Library, Dashboard, Coach). No Whisper yet.
```

## Phase 1

```
Read AGENTS.md. Implement Phase 1 only: mic record (pause/resume + waveform), drag-drop audio (WAV/MP3/M4A/FLAC), local Whisper Large V3 with word/sentence timestamps, Smart Transcript click-to-play, basic WPM + fillers + silent pauses. Persist session + metrics to SQLite. Coach copy must be observation → cause → fix.
```

## Phase 3 (Voice Memory)

```
Read AGENTS.md. Implement Phase 3 only: rolling 7/30/60d dashboard, recurring pattern detection from events, personalized coach that cites history, daily exercises from top weaknesses. Do not add Practice Mode yet.
```
